> =A0But is it an attitudinal --
> even in the rather broad sense -- to which 'pei' could be properly applie=
d?
> "Place" doesn't say much about its role in an utterance; it is one of tho=
se word
> to express position that xorxes mentioned as parallel to the words in emo=
tional
> space? =A0Apparently, from your further remarks. =A0So, 'bu'au' is my way=
 of
